{"title":"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of distinct pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> of real numbers satisfying both of the following equations: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/f/3efc87e2f4232e6f08c076442ac88add1639c2b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=x^2+y^2 \\   \\ y=2xy\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"18\" /> \nis\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/f/fbf2817656383ed83a6837163cdb5ad8fd0478b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }3\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/4/a74263f1ad2d68bdc5b7aa098fe94f5f43b740a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=x^2+y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/2/072575c169982c48050ffb7492947a1dfb5c6c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />, then we can break this into two cases.\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/7/b37ef0c0dd60b77476e21d497b309ea04b8b35dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = x^2$\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf5d5d68b588a00d5c97d06c5739ba0c381243e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>This yields 2 solutions\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/f/a2ff20448834be77dc325234211669d2b44d35aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />, this means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/a/42ab3e4d48ab07ac528daafaa78c0915b6d92597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de14d40b957a7c192e8c7822478f973bdaeb36e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{4} + y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>Because y can be negative or positive, this yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d9ffa7385dfa6d83b977f243e2dee69923bda6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd23acd15944f16e96f54e00af766240e5e951c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"59\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>This yields another 2 solutions.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/8/758050244f5f79dbc64c2a307146738b2c655bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) 4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME\" title=\"1978 AHSME\">1978 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1978 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1978\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1978_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1978 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50